WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.539 --> 00:00:08.255
Hi!

00:00:08.294 --> 00:00:09.153
I'm Ana.

00:00:09.206 --> 00:00:11.028
Welcome to 'What to Say!'

00:00:31.649 --> 00:00:35.685
Do you know what to say when you want to challenge someone's ideas?

00:00:35.816 --> 00:00:40.282
Listen out for useful language for challenging someone's ideas.

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:43.334
