00:00:43.426 --> 00:00:45.118
 after this.

00:00:50.158 --> 00:00:51.954
Guys! I've got it!

00:00:53.127 --> 00:00:54.527
 I've figured it out!

00:00:54.663 --> 00:00:55.743
Figured what out?

00:00:55.796 --> 00:00:58.178
That it's polite to knock on the door before coming in?

00:00:58.322 --> 00:01:00.587
This idea is just too good, Paul!

00:01:00.679 --> 00:01:01.967
It's too good!

00:01:02.059 --> 00:01:02.853
Go on, then.

00:01:03.352 --> 00:01:04.352
So!

00:01:07.727 --> 00:01:08.794
Cats!

00:01:14.186 --> 00:01:16.646
I'm a bit lost. What are you talking about?

00:01:16.803 --> 00:01:17.987
Videos.

00:01:18.248 --> 00:01:19.589
 Cat videos!

00:01:19.863 --> 00:01:21.863
For our social media account.

00:01:22.011 --> 00:01:23.211
Hundreds of them.

00:01:24.772 --> 00:01:26.386
Everyone loves cats!

00:01:26.517 --> 00:01:28.274
I hate cats.

00:01:28.873 --> 00:01:30.527
Everyone except you, Paul.

00:01:30.879 --> 00:01:35.292
Have you considered the fact that we're a branding agency, not a pet shop?

00:01:35.356 --> 00:01:37.193
I take your point, Paul,

00:01:37.259 --> 00:01:39.836
but, come on, be imaginative!

00:01:40.123 --> 00:01:44.863
Cat videos are some of the most searched videos on the internet.

00:01:44.962 --> 00:01:49.115
I see where you're coming from, Vanya, but I think I agree with Paul here.

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:52.008
How is this relevant for a branding agency?

00:01:53.217 --> 00:01:54.217
 Look.

00:01:54.363 --> 00:01:57.761
Social media, it's a numbers game.

00:01:58.517 --> 00:02:02.592
If we share dozens of cat videos each day,

00:02:02.983 --> 00:02:05.157
 then we get more followers.

00:02:05.412 --> 00:02:06.872
That's true.

00:02:07.107 --> 00:02:10.557
So how exactly do you see this working?

00:02:10.584 --> 00:02:13.584
I mean, who's going to find all these videos?

00:02:14.724 --> 00:02:19.503
Erm, OK, I'm very aware of the challenges here,

00:02:19.646 --> 00:02:22.966
but I'm convinced this is going to work.

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:24.958
I'm not so sure.

00:02:25.402 --> 00:02:28.624
Well, I guess you have to look at it from both sides.

00:02:28.703 --> 00:02:33.051
Why don't we try it for a couple of weeks and see if there's any impact?

00:02:33.156 --> 00:02:34.093
Great!

00:02:34.797 --> 00:02:37.465
We are going to get so many more followers.

00:02:37.531 --> 00:02:39.197
I'm absolutely positive!

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:40.213
Good luck with that!

00:02:40.513 --> 00:02:44.210
I hope it doesn't turn out to be a cat-astrophe.

00:02:47.613 --> 00:02:48.613
What?

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:53.810
